      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: if you don't want to do gestures yes, but if you want to make a specific one like a sad face and you are not sure what gesture you have to do then it is extremely helpful to have that hud.\ni try to always use gestures to make the character more alive but i am not always confident if i confused the gesture or if my controller works properly and i don't want to end up making a sad or angry face in the wrong situation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
