      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f3155d76fad944a32038a52|full_name}: oh yeah I definetly know the struggle and how important gestures are, and I think I misread the post. Taking out the camera to see yourself is kinda common so I don't think it's too weird to do it but honestly being able to see your face in some personal HUD would be kinda neat.",
