  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-24T05:14:02.122Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be very convenient to have the option to toggle an HUD element that shows you a front view of your avatars head like the Error's HUD asset but for all avatars.\n \nIt is really annoying that you have to pull out and place your camera, with the lens everyone sees, when you are too insecure with the gestures of an avatar.\nHaving a toggleable HUD with some transparency that only reflects yourself helps a lot to feel more secure with gestures.\nIt would easily work with the most avatars when it will be always in front of the viewpoint (or head bone) and scales with the avatar size.",
